  "description_short": "Clifftop dining at Pinnacle Point with ocean views and a menu celebrating local seafood and steaks.",
  "description_long": "Perched on the dramatic cliffs of Pinnacle Point, The Cliffside Restaurant offers one of Mossel Bay's most spectacular settings for a meal. Floor-to-ceiling windows frame endless ocean views, while the terrace lets you dine in the sea breeze with whales often visible in season.\n\nThe menu focuses on fresh local seafood and quality steaks, withLinefish prepared simply to let the ingredients shine, and generous portions that suit families and groups. It's the kind of place where you linger over lunch watching the waves, or settle in for sundowners before dinner.\n\nWhether you're a golfer coming off the championship course or a visitor chasing Garden Route views, the location alone makes it worth the drive out to Pinnacle Point. The relaxed atmosphere and honest food deliver exactly what you'd hope for in a clifftop restaurant.",
